                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Almost all of the discussion around this game online is thickly lathered in ironic memes so I think it needs to be said with a straight face that Peggle is one of the greatest video games ever created. A deeply polished, masterfully designed and extremely addicting little puzzle game. \n\nPopCap were legitimate industry titans, churning out banger after banger in casual games up until EA hollowed out the innovation in 2011 and doomed them to re-release Bejeweled and hyper-monetise Plants vs Zombies.\n\nI would love a modern release and a PC port of Peggle 2, but coming off of PVZ Replanted there is no doubt they would absolutely screw it up. Still weird how they haven't capitalised at all on the continued legacy success of Peggle though.",
